Source: https://github.com/small-gear-lab/rustls-ffi-quic
Comment: The Rust crates that are linked into the library are not listed here. gen-crate-licenses.py appends a
 paragraph for each of them (and the license paragraphs they need) when the package is built, and the build
 installs their license files under /usr/share/doc/librustls*/vendor-licenses/.
 rustls-ffi-quic is rustls-ffi (https://github.com/rustls/rustls-ffi) with changes, and carries its history.

